{"page":421,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"6.3 • 다중 접속 링크와 프로토콜","words":[{"text":"6.3","x":1012,"y":144,"width":40,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":1086,"y":149,"width":11,"height":12},{"text":"다중","x":1130,"y":142,"width":51,"height":29},{"text":"접속","x":1192,"y":141,"width":51,"height":29},{"text":"링크와","x":1254,"y":141,"width":79,"height":30},{"text":"프로토콜","x":1343,"y":141,"width":106,"height":28}]},{"text":"“말 걸지 않으면 말하지 마라.”","words":[{"text":"“말","x":243,"y":266,"width":48,"height":37},{"text":"걸지","x":305,"y":266,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"않으면","x":385,"y":266,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"말하지","x":501,"y":268,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"마라.”","x":613,"y":269,"width":88,"height":37}]},{"text":"“대화를 독점하지 마라.”","words":[{"text":"“대화를","x":243,"y":327,"width":118,"height":37},{"text":"독점하지","x":372,"y":328,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"마라.”","x":523,"y":329,"width":89,"height":36}]},{"text":"“질문이 있으면 손을 들어라.”","words":[{"text":"“질문이","x":243,"y":387,"width":113,"height":37},{"text":"있으면","x":375,"y":387,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"손을","x":488,"y":389,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"들어라.”","x":568,"y":389,"width":122,"height":37}]},{"text":"“누군가 말하고 있을 때는 방해하지 마라.\"","words":[{"text":"“누군가","x":243,"y":448,"width":118,"height":38},{"text":"말하고","x":373,"y":448,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"있을","x":490,"y":448,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"때는","x":570,"y":449,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"방해하지","x":648,"y":449,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"마라.\"","x":793,"y":450,"width":85,"height":38}]},{"text":"“다른 사람이 말하고 있을 때는 잠들지 마라.”","words":[{"text":"“다른","x":244,"y":509,"width":82,"height":37},{"text":"사람이","x":338,"y":508,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"말하고","x":454,"y":509,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"있을","x":571,"y":510,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"때는","x":649,"y":510,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"잠들지","x":727,"y":510,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"마라.”","x":837,"y":511,"width":87,"height":36}]},{"text":"이와 유사하게, 컴퓨터 네트워크에서도 공유되는 브로드개스트 채널로 보내는 노","words":[{"text":"이와","x":245,"y":603,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"유사하게,","x":326,"y":603,"width":146,"height":38},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":493,"y":603,"width":92,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크에서도","x":606,"y":603,"width":231,"height":39},{"text":"공유되는","x":851,"y":604,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"브로드개스트","x":997,"y":603,"width":199,"height":36},{"text":"채널로","x":1211,"y":602,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"보내는","x":1325,"y":602,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"노","x":1441,"y":606,"width":32,"height":27}]},{"text":"드들의 전송을 조정하기 위한 다중 접속 프로토*(multiple access protocol)이라는","words":[{"text":"드들의","x":179,"y":665,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"전송을","x":298,"y":665,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"조정하기","x":417,"y":664,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"위한","x":571,"y":664,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"다중","x":654,"y":665,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"접속","x":736,"y":665,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"프로토*(multiple","x":818,"y":666,"width":278,"height":39},{"text":"access","x":1110,"y":675,"width":100,"height":21},{"text":"protocol)이라는","x":1224,"y":663,"width":250,"height":41}]},{"text":"프로토콜이 있다. 그림 6.8처럼 다중 접속 프로토콜은 유선 및 무선 근거리망과 위성망","words":[{"text":"프로토콜이","x":178,"y":726,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":363,"y":726,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"그림","x":452,"y":726,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"6.8처럼","x":532,"y":725,"width":111,"height":37},{"text":"다중","x":660,"y":725,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"접속","x":739,"y":725,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜은","x":816,"y":725,"width":164,"height":37},{"text":"유선","x":992,"y":724,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"및","x":1072,"y":724,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"무선","x":1115,"y":724,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"근거리망과","x":1194,"y":723,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"위성망","x":1376,"y":723,"width":99,"height":38}]},{"text":"을 포함하는 다양한 네트워크 설정에서 필요하다. 비록 노드는 기술적으로 자신의 어","words":[{"text":"을","x":178,"y":789,"width":32,"height":37},{"text":"포함하는","x":226,"y":788,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"다양한","x":379,"y":788,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크","x":497,"y":786,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"설정에서","x":647,"y":786,"width":127,"height":38},{"text":"필요하다.","x":794,"y":786,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"비록","x":951,"y":785,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"노드는","x":1030,"y":786,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"기술적으로","x":1146,"y":785,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"자신의","x":1326,"y":784,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"어","x":1443,"y":784,"width":28,"height":38}]},{"text":"냅터를 통해 브로드개스트 채널에 접근하지만, 이 절에서는 노드를 송신 장지나 수신","words":[{"text":"냅터를","x":180,"y":849,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"통해","x":294,"y":849,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"브로드개스트","x":378,"y":848,"width":205,"height":37},{"text":"채널에","x":600,"y":847,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"접근하지만,","x":715,"y":847,"width":172,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":906,"y":846,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"절에서는","x":954,"y":846,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"노드를","x":1099,"y":847,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"송신","x":1210,"y":846,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"장지나","x":1292,"y":845,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"수신","x":1408,"y":845,"width":66,"height":38}]},{"text":"장치라고 하겠다. 실제로 수백 혹은 수천 개의 노드가 브로드개스트 채널에서 직접 통","words":[{"text":"장치라고","x":179,"y":909,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"하겠다.","x":327,"y":909,"width":110,"height":38},{"text":"실제로","x":455,"y":909,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"수백","x":569,"y":907,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"혹은","x":650,"y":907,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"수천","x":729,"y":907,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"개의","x":810,"y":907,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"노드가","x":889,"y":907,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"브로드개스트","x":1002,"y":907,"width":199,"height":38},{"text":"채널에서","x":1216,"y":906,"width":128,"height":39},{"text":"직접","x":1364,"y":906,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"통","x":1442,"y":907,"width":34,"height":37}]},{"text":"신할수 있다.","words":[{"text":"신할수","x":180,"y":971,"width":109,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":304,"y":970,"width":74,"height":37}]},{"text":"모든 노드들이 프레임을 전송할 수 있으므로, 2개 이상의 노드가 동시에 프레임을","words":[{"text":"모든","x":242,"y":1032,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"노드들이","x":323,"y":1031,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"프레임을","x":475,"y":1031,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"전송할","x":626,"y":1030,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":736,"y":1031,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"있으므로,","x":785,"y":1030,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"2개","x":939,"y":1031,"width":49,"height":37},{"text":"이상의","x":1006,"y":1030,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"노드가","x":1117,"y":1030,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"동시에","x":1228,"y":1030,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"프레임을","x":1342,"y":1030,"width":135,"height":37}]},{"text":"전송할 수 있다. 이런 일이 발생하면, 모든 노드는 동시에 여러 개의 프레임을 받게 된","words":[{"text":"전송할","x":179,"y":1091,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":290,"y":1091,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":341,"y":1092,"width":73,"height":37},{"text":"이런","x":432,"y":1092,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"일이","x":515,"y":1091,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"발생하면,","x":595,"y":1092,"width":142,"height":37},{"text":"모든","x":751,"y":1094,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"노드는","x":832,"y":1093,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"동시에","x":944,"y":1092,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"여러","x":1059,"y":1091,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"개의","x":1139,"y":1092,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"프레임을","x":1217,"y":1091,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"받게","x":1364,"y":1091,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"된","x":1444,"y":1091,"width":32,"height":37}]},{"text":"다. 즉, 전송된 프레임들이 각 수신자에서 충돌(해lide)한다. 일반적으로 충돌이 발생","words":[{"text":"다.","x":179,"y":1153,"width":38,"height":37},{"text":"즉,","x":233,"y":1154,"width":41,"height":35},{"text":"전송된","x":293,"y":1152,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"프레임들이","x":409,"y":1153,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"각","x":596,"y":1153,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"수신자에서","x":643,"y":1152,"width":165,"height":39},{"text":"충돌(해lide)한다.","x":825,"y":1153,"width":274,"height":39},{"text":"일반적으로","x":1117,"y":1154,"width":164,"height":37},{"text":"충돌이","x":1294,"y":1152,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"발생","x":1410,"y":1153,"width":63,"height":38}]},{"text":"하면 어떤 수신 노드도 전송된 프레임의 의미를 파악할 수 없게 된다. 즉, 충돌 프레임","words":[{"text":"하면","x":179,"y":1213,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"어떤","x":258,"y":1214,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"수신","x":338,"y":1214,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"노드도","x":421,"y":1218,"width":103,"height":27},{"text":"전송된","x":539,"y":1214,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"프레임의","x":653,"y":1214,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"의미를","x":802,"y":1215,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"파악할","x":915,"y":1215,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1027,"y":1215,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"없게","x":1075,"y":1215,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"된다.","x":1154,"y":1215,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"즉,","x":1241,"y":1216,"width":41,"height":36},{"text":"충돌","x":1296,"y":1214,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"프레임","x":1377,"y":1214,"width":97,"height":38}]},{"text":"의 신호는 해석할 수 없을 정도로 엉망이 된다. 따라서 충돌에 관련된 모든 프레임은","words":[{"text":"의","x":179,"y":1275,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"신호는","x":227,"y":1275,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"해석할","x":343,"y":1275,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":461,"y":1276,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"없을","x":513,"y":1275,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"정도로","x":596,"y":1275,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"엉망이","x":714,"y":1276,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"된다.","x":829,"y":1276,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"따라서","x":920,"y":1276,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"충돌에","x":1033,"y":1276,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"관련된","x":1148,"y":1276,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"모든","x":1261,"y":1277,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"프레임은","x":1344,"y":1276,"width":134,"height":38}]},{"text":"손실되며, 브로드개스트 채널은 충돌 기간만큼 낭비된다. 만일 다수의 노드가 빈번히","words":[{"text":"손실되며,","x":178,"y":1336,"width":142,"h